prompt:
These are corporate environmental claims that our carbon-accounting rule set did not flag.
For each, identify any technical term, metric, or accounting concept that could hide a scoping or
boundary problem but is not covered by these nine existing rules: market-based vs location-based
Scope 2, REC/PPA grid matching, carbon neutral offsets, missing baseline year, missing scope
boundary, cherry-picked PUE, water accounting, future promises without milestones, matching
language.

CLAIMS:
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_199", "text": "Leaking pipes account for an estimated 30% of global water losses."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_219", "text": "Microsoft achieved 90.9% reuse and recycling of servers and components in FY24 through its Circular Centers."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_220", "text": "Microsoft surpassed its 90% reuse and recycling target for servers and components a year early."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_221", "text": "Microsoft diverted 85.3% of construction and demolition waste from landfills and incinerators in FY24."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_222", "text": "Microsoft exceeded its annual 75% construction and demolition waste diversion target six years ahead of schedule."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_223", "text": "In FY24 we diverted approximately 26,000 metric tons of waste from being landfilled or incinerated across our owned datacenters and campuses."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_225", "text": "In 2024, 100% of our new owned datacenters located in Europe and the Asia-Pacific region began operations with durable serviceware."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_231", "text": "Utilization of lightweight, reusable expanded polystyrene pallets for shipments from contract manufacturers drove a carbon emission reduction of 1,528 mtCO2e out of Microsoft's global logistics network."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_254", "text": "Surface Copilot+ PCs now feature 100% recycled aluminum alloy in the enclosures."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_255", "text": "Surface Copilot+ PCs now feature 100% recycled rare earth metals in magnets."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_263", "text": "CIF has allocated over $793 million in capital to bring new supply to market and accelerate adoption and cost reduction in key target technologies."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_265", "text": "Sectors critical to Microsoft's Scope 3 carbon footprint—industry and manufacturing, building materials, and carbon management—account for approximately 20% of private market climate technology transactions."}
{"claim_id": "msft_sr_270", "text": "CIF's $793 million in commitments has catalyzed over $3.3 billion in follow-on funding, achieving a multiplier effect greater than four times."}
{"claim_id": "amzn_sr_300", "text": "Since 2019, Amazon's revenue has grown 156%, with a 12% increase in 2025 alone."}
{"claim_id": "amzn_sr_305", "text": "We purchased 39.5 million gallons of renewable natural gas in 2025."}

Output ONLY a JSON array: [{"term": "...", "why_it_matters": "one sentence",
"example_claim_id": "..."}]. Return [] if nothing new.

